WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.720
Children learn the mitzvah through suitable practice.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.900
Begin teaching with a manageable rehearsal, then

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.000
teach the complete act.

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:09.220
A small learning step does not reduce

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:09.840
the mitzvah.
